5,1,1,talk,Rin,,Hi everyone! I want our trash corner to be super clean and not smelly! Let's find the best way to fix it!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"It is nice to see everyone. I agree, we should find a solution that makes everyone happy and keeps the peace.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's not get too sentimental. We need a practical arrangement that doesn't create more work than it solves.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,"Exactly! I'm in, but let's make sure we aren't just picking the easiest-looking option without knowing the actual effort involved.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I agree. We need a logical approach. We should examine the data regarding the current situation and the requirements before deciding.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I want to know what it's like for other people! I'll check ""Supervised mornings on the next lane"" and ""Visit to the station block's bin house""!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I think it would be wise to look at the ""Block ledger of refuse-point expenses"" and ""Ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs.""","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll take ""Statements at the residents' meeting"" and ""The station block's meeting minutes."" I want to see how others handled the social fallout.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"I'm curious about the time commitment. I'll look into ""Supervised mornings on the next lane"" and ""Truck arrival time from the crew leader.""","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I will investigate ""Ward complaint log for this point"" and ""Measurements of the five frontages"" to see if the current spot is actually fair.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@May, you're checking the same thing as me! Maybe we can compare what we find later!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,"That sounds like a lovely idea, Rin. It is always better to have a second pair of eyes on the information.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,As long as it doesn't lead to a gossip circle. Let's just stick to the facts for now.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, you're so grumpy! But you're right, let's just get the data first. I'm excited to see the results!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I agree. Let us proceed with the research so we can have a productive discussion based on evidence.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
