40,2,1,talk,Rin,,"I found out that the bin house at the station block smells really bad in the summer! Like, super sour!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,1,talk,Midori,,"I discovered that we spend quite a bit on nets and deodorants every year, and building a shelter is actually very expensive.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"It seems people are reluctant to actually enforce rules. Nobody wants to be the ""trash police"" and turn away late bags.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,1,talk,May,,The supervised mornings take almost an hour! And the truck comes so early that some people might still be asleep.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The complaint log shows that one household has been doing most of the complaining because the point is at their gate.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@May, an hour is a long time! I don't want to stand there forever. And the smell thing is scary!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Asuka, it is sad that one neighbor has felt so burdened. We should definitely consider a way to share that weight.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Midori, sharing the weight is fine, but if we just move the problem, we're just rotating the anger.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,2,talk,May,,"@Rin, exactly! If we have to wake up super early just to watch trash, it's going to be a nightmare for whoever is on duty.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, that is why we need to look at the frontages. Some of our spaces are much narrower than others.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,3,talk,Rin,,"If the bin house smells, maybe we shouldn't build one? I don't want our street to smell like sour socks!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,3,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Rin. If the costs are high and the result is a smell that carries, it might not be the best balance.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,I also found that the station block started fighting over who sweeps the bin house. A permanent structure just creates new chores.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,3,talk,May,,"See? This is what I mean! We can't just add more ""maintenance"" to our lives. Who is going to do the sweeping?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,3,talk,Asuka,,It is clear that the current location is unsustainable given the complaints and the physical constraints of the frontages.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,2,4,talk,Rin,,I just want it to be easy and not smelly!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
56,2,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
57,2,4,talk,Midori,,I hope we can find a way that is fair to everyone's budget and feelings.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
