59,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,Let's just hope the options aren't all terrible.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
