70,3,1,talk,Rin,,"Option A sounds like a lot of waiting, Option B is moving things, and Option C is the smelly house! I don't like C!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,1,talk,Midori,,"Option C is very expensive, and as Rin said, the smell could be an issue. Option A and B seem more affordable.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Option A requires people to be ""police,"" which I already know nobody wants to do. Option B is just shifting the grudge.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,1,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, but Option A's ""supervising"" takes an hour! That's way too much work for a few mornings a year.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Option B addresses the unfairness of the current location, but the ward requires a new notice for every single site change.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,2,talk,Rin,,"If we do Option B, we get to move the trash! That sounds like an adventure, and it's not a smelly house!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,2,talk,Midori,,"@Asuka, if the paperwork for Option B is too much, maybe Option A is better? But the early hours are a worry.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Option A is a recipe for neighborly disputes. ""You put your bag out at 8:01, I'm reporting you!"" No thank you.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,2,talk,May,,"I agree with Shunichi. Option A is too stressful. Option B is better because you just move the spot, you don't police people.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"Option B is the most equitable in terms of frontage usage, despite the administrative burden of the notices.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,3,3,talk,Rin,,I vote for Option B! It's the most fun and doesn't smell like sour socks!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
81,3,3,talk,Midori,,"I worry about the budget for the notices, but it is the kindest way to treat the neighbor who has had the bins. I vote B.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
82,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,"It's the least likely to cause a daily fight, even if it's a bit of a hassle to move. I'll go with Option B.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
83,3,3,talk,May,,"No supervising, no expensive building, and no early morning shifts. Option B is the winner for me! I vote B.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
84,3,3,talk,Asuka,,It is the only option that logically distributes the burden of the location. I vote for Option B.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
85,3,4,talk,Rin,,Yay! We all agree! Option B it is!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
